('128.35.c.7.J',4,'Defending a claim requires:','["opinions alone", "repetition only", "volume", "reasons and evidence from the text"]'::jsonb,3,'Defenses rely on support.','original'),
('128.35.c.7.K',2,'A newcomer says, ''I happy today.'' This shows the learner is:','["expressing feelings with simple language", "refusing to speak", "citing sources", "writing an essay"]'::jsonb,0,'Early expression uses simple forms.','original'),
('128.35.c.7.K',2,'As proficiency grows, a learner''s expression of ideas moves toward:','["shorter silences only", "more detailed and varied sentences", "only single words", "fewer ideas"]'::jsonb,1,'Language expands with proficiency.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.A',4,'A character who keeps helping others despite losing everything most clearly develops the theme of:','["boredom", "luck", "generosity", "greed"]'::jsonb,2,'The character''s choices show the theme.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.A',4,'Comparing similar themes in two stories means:','["retelling one only", "listing authors", "counting pages", "showing how each plot develops the same idea"]'::jsonb,3,'Theme comparison looks at development.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.B',4,'An archetype is:','["a recurring character type, such as the hero or mentor", "a rare spelling", "a map symbol", "a type of rhyme"]'::jsonb,0,'Archetypes recur across literature.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.B',4,'A character who is kind but also stubborn feels:','["flat and unreal", "complex and believable", "absent", "unfinished"]'::jsonb,1,'Mixed traits make characters real.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.C',4,'An isolated scene in which a character makes a key choice contributes to the plot by:','["removing the conflict", "listing the setting", "changing what happens next", "ending the book"]'::jsonb,2,'Scenes drive the plot.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.D',4,'A story set during a drought makes characters'' choices about water seem:','["unimportant", "silly", "unrelated", "urgent and meaningful"]'::jsonb,3,'Setting raises the stakes.','original'),
('128.35.c.8.D',4,'Cultural setting can affect a plot because customs shape:','["what characters value and do", "the font", "the page count", "the cover"]'::jsonb,0,'Culture influences characterization and plot.','original'),
